  "id": "BIT-sqlite-2026-119591",
  "summary": "SQLite before 3.54.0 Stack Exhaustion via countOfViewOptimization() in VALUES Clause",
  "details": "SQLite before 3.54.0 contains a stack exhaustion vulnerability in countOfViewOptimization() that allows attackers to crash the host process via count(*) over a large multi-row VALUES clause. Attackers supplying SQL or a database file with a crafted view can trigger deeply nested TK_PLUS expressions whose recursive freeing in sqlite3ExprDeleteNN() exhausts the C stack, causing denial of service.",
